"""Read-only Task #409 candidate-3 execution preflight.

The preflight checks three explicitly supplied, already-approved artifact paths.
It never opens a repository, invokes Git, executes the embedded shell, replays a
patch, changes a ref, or contacts a service.  A future ``--execute`` switch is
recognized only as a deliberate boundary and is rejected because no executor is
implemented in this planning-only tool.

All artifact reads use the copied frozen-pair helper.  Its held parent and child
O_NOFOLLOW descriptors, repeated identity checks, and canonical-path checks are
used because a hash of bytes is not sufficient if a pathname can be swapped
while the review is running.
"""
